{"articleNo":"77584","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=77584&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013-1학기 근로장학생 선발 확정 및 출근부 입력 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.02.28","hit":"6362","attachments":[{"name":"국가 및 대학근로장학생 선발자 명단.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=77584&attachNo=2754"},{"name":"2013-1학기 국가근로장학생 시간표 및 출근부 입력 매뉴얼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=77584&attachNo=2763"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-1학기 근로장학생 선발 확정 및&nbsp;출근부 입력 안내</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로기간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 국가근로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 3. 4(월) ~ 6. 23(일)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 대학근로 : 2013. 3. 1(금) ~ 6. 23(일)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 근로장학생 선발자 통보방법 : 대상자에게 개인별 문자통보</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 근로장학금 지급일 : 매월 10일 예정[3월 근로한 경우 4. 10(수) 지급]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">국가근로장학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">시간표 및 출근부 입력 방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학생 매뉴얼 참조</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;나</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">시간표 입력 기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 3. 4(월) 12:00&nbsp;~ 3. 8(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">금</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">출근부 입력 기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">일 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">기간 초과 시 입력 불가, 근로 인정 안됨</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대학근로장학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근무상황부 입력 방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스 → 학생지원 → 근로장학생 근무상황부 입력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근무상황부 입력 시 학업시간표와 시간 중복 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 유의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;가. 최종 수강시간표(수강시간표 정정시)와 근로시간은 중복 안됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;나</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">근로장학생은 기한 내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">근로 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일 이내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">출근부를 반드시 입력</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">!!</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">기간 초과 시 절대 입력 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학적변동자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">휴학</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제적</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">졸업 등</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">일 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">근로 불가능</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로장학금 지급불가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 휴학은 신청한 날부터 근로 불가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 근로 추가모집안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 국가근로 : 도서관(문의 : 054-478-7164)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 컴퓨터관련 학과 남학생 1명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - PC관리 및 서버관리, 비도서 대출반납(18:00~21:00)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 국가 및 대학근로 : 학생식당(문의 : 054-478-7049)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;모집인원(국가,대학) 총&nbsp;8명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 배식보조, 분식보조, 식기세척</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 국가 및 대학근로장학생 선발자 명단 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. 2013-1학기 국가근로장학생 시간표 및 출근부 입력 매뉴얼 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 2. 28.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학 생 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
